ding workflows</div>\n                <div class=\"bullet\">site-specific deployment readiness</div>\n                <div class=\"bullet\">reporting and operational instrumentation</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"milestone\">\n              <div class=\"milestone-head\">\n                <div class=\"milestone-left\">\n                  <div class=\"milestone-step\">Deploy</div>\n                  <div class=\"milestone-title\">Launch 3 pilot sites</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"milestone-outcome\">Demonstrate that Designer can be implemented and used in real visit environments.</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"milestone-body\">\n                <div class=\"bullet\">live pilot implementations</div>\n                <div class=\"bullet\">provider and staff onboarding</div>\n                <div class=\"bullet\">site feedback loop into product</div>\n                <div class=\"bullet\">deployment playbook development</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"milestone\">\n              <div class=\"milestone-head\">\n                <div class=\"milestone-left\">\n                  <div class=\"milestone-step\">Validate</div>\n                  <div class=\"milestone-title\">Prove value and repeatability</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"milestone-outcome\">Generate the evidence needed to move from first pilots to a repeatable deployment motion.</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"milestone-body\">\n                <div class=\"bullet\">usage and workflow adoption signals</div>\n                <div class=\"bullet\">time / operational value metrics</div>\n                <div class=\"bullet\">referenceable pilot outcomes</div>\n                <div class=\"bullet\">clear next-round proof points</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div 